{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0204_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0e5402f261463ae29f520a5a8a42459f86a76fcfba728cc5c4cf695dabb31eb5", "ja": "のり子、新しい衣装はどうだ？\n気に入ってもらえたかな？", "zh": "法子，新衣服感觉怎么样？\n还喜欢吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0204_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "467cac1be8f89d905e1d3df9bc9b07d99ddbca2246f106697da8c863febb661a", "ja": "もちろん！　もう最高っ！\n家でも着たいなー、って思うくらいだよ！", "zh": "当然啦！简直太棒了！\n我甚至都想在家里也穿上了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0204_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d846a76edeebb208ae9d57fc3678045f073c3d9b66fc037b62d0c88cc0e15d5a", "ja": "そんなに気に入ったのか……。でも、家で着るには\nちょっと……生活しづらいんじゃないかな。", "zh": "这么喜欢啊……不过，要是在家里穿的话，生活起来会不会有点……不方便。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0204_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "ba4d85febb754ff9efc4b3a0447a40ea35d5062c17901861de1ef5b90336e969", "ja": "あはは、さすがにそれは冗談だけど……\nでも、気に入っているのは、本当！", "zh": "啊哈哈，虽然那确实是在开玩笑……  \n不过，喜欢这套服装是真的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0204_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "25be530a062ab994521415c4a704c237a6bf269416a6c070bd4a4792db9cdea3", "ja": "せっかくのいい衣装だから、大事に着ないとね。\nでも{$P$}、このデザインって……。", "zh": "难得有这么漂亮的服装，可得好好珍惜着穿才行。\n不过{$P$}，这个设计……有点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0204_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a71373068bdd17fa601b023773b8b33307aa9a670e244129dece401285f810b3", "ja": "どうかしたか？", "zh": "怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0204_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "01cfd037ed098ac7c6040748a0221a62c38504c9ea16c82313267492f7908daf", "ja": "うん。レースクイーン風かと思ったんだけど、\nレーサーっぽい雰囲気もあるなぁって。", "zh": "嗯。我本来以为是赛车女郎风格的，不过感觉也有点像赛车手。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0204_1007_p", "source_sha256": "db1adcad364f9da1173723e5ba829b5f783d00519109577224d5d606c31441c6", "ja": "ああ。バイク好きののり子に似合う格好って考えたら、\n自然とこんな感じになったんだ。", "zh": "啊。我想着要打扮成适合喜欢摩托车的典子，结果自然而然就成了这种感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0204_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "4f162796fd13667c2d2458129cff473fd01a86e5456dd27dc1ab97fbe0669e06", "ja": "そっかぁ。アタシ、バイクはツーリングがメインだから\nレースには詳しくはなかったんだけど……。", "zh": "这样啊。我主要是骑摩托车兜风，所以以前对赛车还不太了解……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0204_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "aad6cec396d919064c344f60a3f1ceeae9dc4c9cf881bc4b715f9f4472e2abc2", "ja": "この衣装をもらったら、なんかちょっと\n気になっちゃって。動画とか見てみたんだ。", "zh": "拿到这套服装后，不知怎么的就有点在意了。还去看了看相关视频。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0204_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b10e16b4b3fcb4828351e69dbf17e2feab329f96baab06694ed2139f9c4c4126", "ja": "動画って、バイクレースの？", "zh": "你说的视频，是摩托车比赛的视频吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0204_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "edba39e18b749342d9323fbba09f6452c83d55fffa272c085b1fc4e5cc064452", "ja": "うん！　えっと、最初はレースクイーンとか\n調べてたんだよ？　参考になるかもって。", "zh": "嗯！那个……一开始我是在查赛车女郎之类的哦？想着说不定能作为参考。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0204_1012_p", "source_sha256": "379b13506c7ce4b4e71464b8dc83816441a8ca8542839161f2fbe064a62477eb", "ja": "なるほど。そうやって見ている内に、\nレース自体に興味が出てしまったと……。", "zh": "原来如此。也就是说，在那样看的过程中，开始对赛车本身产生兴趣了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0204_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "60b2065d72ac2835db45e3e5165c7bec19e19b4f88acfa9ea29a80cb610f75af", "ja": "ま、まあそういうこと。プロレスとはまた違った、\n手に汗握る展開が多くてさ！", "zh": "总、总之就是这么回事。和职业摔角不一样，比赛中有很多让人捏一把汗的紧张发展嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0204_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "f2538c68549d18ba4dc10cfd4b9893efd7ea456905455bcb8a733726fd36a30e", "ja": "あとは大きなバイクとか、それを乗りこなす\nレーサーの鍛え方に目が行っちゃって。えへへ。", "zh": "还有就是忍不住会去关注帅气的大摩托，\n还有能把车驾驭自如的赛车手的锻炼成果呢。嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0204_1015_p", "source_sha256": "ff95361f3f93c80cc45fe502ab4a6509440a6b91fd3dce711292e6a106bff179", "ja": "のり子……まさかとは思うけど、\nバイクレースに出たいなんて事は……。", "zh": "诺莉子……我虽然觉得不至于，但你该不会是想参加摩托车比赛……吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0204_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "945c22887f9d351aaf2926b9e10d77745198f515333e0b1c2657becb50f119fd", "ja": "あはっ、大丈夫！\nそりゃ、ちょっとは考えたけど……。", "zh": "啊哈，没事的！\n虽然嘛，确实稍微想过一下就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0204_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "5286fb2861dd391de30f02245494bbd2efd054d0f1c4a63f923f2e2cc8ca7401", "ja": "でもアタシは、マイペースに運転して\n出かけるくらいが、性に合ってるからね♪", "zh": "不过我还是觉得，按自己的节奏开车出去兜兜风，更适合我♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0204_1018_p", "source_sha256": "910833f51bb46dbc3a9409d442a36422db4ab13e274df8a503aa174316472329", "ja": "そうか。……確かに、同じレースなら、\nのり子はレースクイーンの方が似合うと思うよ。", "zh": "这样啊。……确实，要是参加同一场比赛，我觉得还是让你当赛车女郎更合适。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0204_1019_p", "source_sha256": "f1ee494ec3ec89886e382da64fd3c05eb213b849ac4b64c2ff73c0bfb70cbb66", "ja": "あとはアイドルとして、\nステージを盛り上げてほしいけどな。", "zh": "不过作为偶像，我还是希望你能让舞台热闹起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0204_1020_043nor", "source_sha256": "80c258dea5b263126e66d6210bcc49bad9bf3890d0a7890895dec74c3a574f3c", "ja": "あはは！　そうだよね。\nもちろん、ステージだってばっちこいだよ！", "zh": "啊哈哈！说得也是呢。\n舞台表演我也完全不在话下哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0204_1021_043nor", "source_sha256": "79f1fd5ad6105fd33095e6e31a297bd1799314ce715b617590eeacde3015a114", "ja": "この衣装でトップ独走、思いっきり走り抜けて、\n全力で盛り上げてみせるからさ！", "zh": "我要穿着这身服装一路遥遥领先，尽情冲刺到底，\n拿出全力把气氛炒热给你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0204_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "13b3cb581c526539e2ce726cd389823c18cc3059023b68bc871881fb1ab0e267", "ja": "ゴールする瞬間、見逃さないでよね、\n{$P$}！", "zh": "进球的瞬间，可别错过了，\n{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
